<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes">
  <title>Chè Thong Dong — Tiệm Chè &amp; Đá Bào Thanh Hóa | Thực Đơn Món Ngon</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Thưởng thức chè bưởi thốt nốt, chè khoai dẻo, đá bào tuyết hoa quả, trà hoa quả giải nhiệt tại Chè Thong Dong. Địa chỉ: Số 02A88 Đại Lộ Lê Lợi, P. Hạc Thành, TP. Thanh Hóa. Hotline: 0357938009.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="Chè Thong Dong, tiệm chè Thanh Hóa, chè bưởi thốt nốt, đá bào tuyết, chè khoai dẻo, ăn vặt Thanh Hóa, đồ uống ngon Thanh Hóa">
  <meta name="author" content="Chè Thong Dong">

  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="restaurant.restaurant">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Chè Thong Dong — Tiệm Chè &amp; Đá Bào Thanh Hóa">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Thanh mát từng muỗng • Thong dong từng phút giây. Khám phá thực đơn chè ngon & đá bào tuyết đặc sản Thanh Hóa.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="/images/hero_dessert.webp">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="vi_VN">

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo_icon.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/logo_icon.png">

  <!-- Google Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans & Playfair Display -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;0,800;1,600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Bootstrap Icons -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* ----------------------------------------------------
       DESIGN SYSTEM & TOKENS: CHÈ THONG DONG
       Aesthetic: Fresh Emerald Matcha, Warm Honey, Ivory Cream
       ---------------------------------------------------- */
    :root {
      --primary: #1b4332;
      --primary-light: #2d6a4f;
      --primary-soft: #40916c;
      --primary-subtle: #d8f3dc;
      --primary-tint: #f0fdf4;
      
      --accent: #d4a373;
      --accent-warm: #bc6c25;
      --accent-glow: #e9c46a;
      --accent-cream: #faedcd;
      
      --bg-cream: #faf7f2;
      --bg-card: #ffffff;
      --bg-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      
      --text-main: #19201d;
      --text-muted: #5c6660;
      --text-light: #89948e;
      
      --border-subtle: rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.08);
      --border-focus: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.3);
      
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.04);
      --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px -4px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.08);
      --shadow-lg: 0 20px 40px -8px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.14);
      --shadow-float: 0 16px 32px rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.22);
      
      --radius-sm: 10px;
      --radius-md: 16px;
      --radius-lg: 24px;
      --radius-full: 9999px;
      
      --font-body: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    }

    /* ---- RESET & GLOBAL ---- */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      font-size: 16px;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      padding-bottom: 84px; /* Space for mobile floating dock */
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button, input {
      font-family: inherit;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    /* Container */
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    /* ---- TOP ANNOUNCEMENT BAR ---- */
    .top-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1b4332 0%, #2d6a4f 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 101;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .top-bar .live-dot {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: #4ade80;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.35);
      animation: pulseLive 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes pulseLive {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.7; }
    }

    /* ---- STICKY HEADER ---- */
    .header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(250, 247, 242, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .header.scrolled {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 72px;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .header-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .header-logo {
      height: 44px;
      width: 44px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .header-brand-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .header-brand-info h1 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .header-brand-info span {
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .call-text-desktop {
      display: inline;
    }
    .call-text-mobile {
      display: none;
    }
    .top-bar-text-desk {
      display: inline;
    }
    .top-bar-text-mobi {
      display: none;
    }

    /* Nav Links (Desktop) */
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .nav-link {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {
      color: var(--primary);
      background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.08);
    }
    .header-cta-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .btn-call-header {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.2);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .btn-call-header:hover {
      background: var(--primary-light);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.28);
    }

    /* ---- HERO SECTION ---- */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 48px 0 64px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -20%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(233, 196, 106, 0.22) 0%, rgba(250, 247, 242, 0) 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.2);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .hero-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      max-width: 540px;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .btn-primary-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b4332 0%, #2d6a4f 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.28);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .btn-primary-hero:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.35);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d6a4f 0%, #40916c 100%);
    }
    .btn-secondary-hero {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--primary);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-secondary-hero:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary-light);
      background: var(--primary-tint);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Trust highlights */
    .hero-stats {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    .stat-pill {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .stat-pill i {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
    }
    .stat-pill strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .stat-pill span {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-light);
    }

    /* Hero Media Visual */
    .hero-media-wrapper {
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-media-card {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      border: 4px solid #ffffff;
      aspect-ratio: 16/11;
      transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(-3deg) rotateX(2deg);
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .hero-media-card:hover {
      transform: perspective(1000px) rotateY(0deg) rotateX(0deg);
    }
    .hero-media-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.6s ease;
    }
    .hero-media-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }
    .hero-floating-badge {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -16px;
      left: -16px;
      background: var(--bg-glass);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 12px 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      animation: floatSlow 4s infinite ease-in-out;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    @keyframes floatSlow {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }
    .hero-floating-badge .badge-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a373, #bc6c25);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .hero-floating-badge div strong {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      display: block;
    }
    .hero-floating-badge div span {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* ---- 4 VALUE PILLARS (GIÁ TRỊ CỐT LÕI) ---- */
    .section-values {
      padding: 36px 0 60px;
    }
    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .value-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .value-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border-color: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.25);
    }
    .value-card-thumb {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 16/11;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #f1f5f9;
    }
    .value-card-thumb img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    .value-card:hover .value-card-thumb img {
      transform: scale(1.06);
    }
    .value-pill-badge {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 8px;
      left: 8px;
      background: rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    .value-card-body {
      padding: 16px 16px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .value-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .value-card p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* ---- SECTION HEADER COMMON ---- */
    .section-head {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }
    .section-tag {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* ---- MENU SHOWCASE SECTION ---- */
    .section-menu {
      padding: 64px 0 80px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    /* Search & Filter Controls */
    .menu-filter-wrapper {
      position: sticky;
      top: 72px;
      z-index: 90;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      padding: 16px 0 12px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    .filter-bar-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .search-box {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .search-box i {
      position: absolute;
      left: 16px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: var(--text-light);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .search-input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 42px 12px 46px;
      background: var(--bg-cream);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .search-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.12);
    }
    .search-clear {
      position: absolute;
      right: 14px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: none;
      color: var(--text-light);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: none;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .search-clear.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    /* Horizontal Category Scroll (Mobile optimized touch scroll) */
    .category-pills-container {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      padding: 4px 4px 8px;
    }
    .category-pills-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .cat-pill {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: var(--bg-cream);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .cat-pill:hover {
      background: var(--primary-tint);
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .cat-pill.active {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.25);
    }

    /* Products Grid */
    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(270px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .product-card {
      background: var(--bg-cream);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .product-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border-color: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.25);
    }
    .product-card:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }
    .card-thumb-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #e9ecef;
    }
    .card-thumb-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    .product-card:hover .card-thumb-img {
      transform: scale(1.06);
    }
    .card-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 12px;
      left: 12px;
      background: var(--accent-warm);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .card-badge.signature {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b4332, #2d6a4f);
    }
    .card-category-tag {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    }
    .card-content {
      padding: 18px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .card-desc {
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .card-toppings-preview {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .topping-chip {
      background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.08);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    }
    .card-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px dashed rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.12);
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .card-price {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .btn-card-order {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.2);
    }
    .product-card:hover .btn-card-order {
      background: var(--primary-light);
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    /* Empty state */
    .empty-state {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .empty-state i {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--text-light);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: block;
    }

    /* ---- TOPPINGS SECTION ---- */
    .section-toppings {
      padding: 60px 0;
      background: var(--bg-cream);
    }
    .toppings-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .topping-item-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .topping-item-info {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .topping-item-info i {
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .topping-item-name {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .topping-item-price {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
    }

    /* ---- ABOUT / ATMOSPHERE SECTION ---- */
    .section-about {
      padding: 80px 0;
      position: relative;
    }
    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .about-image-collage {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .about-img-main {
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      border: 4px solid #ffffff;
      overflow: hidden;
      aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    }
    .about-img-main img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .about-img-sub {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .about-img-sub-item {
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border: 3px solid #ffffff;
      aspect-ratio: 1/1;
    }
    .about-img-sub-item img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .about-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .about-content p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .about-highlights {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    .about-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .about-item i {
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    /* ---- STORE INFO & MAP SECTION ---- */
    .section-contact {
      padding: 72px 0 84px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .info-card-box {
      background: var(--bg-cream);
      padding: 36px 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .info-card-box h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .info-card-box .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .info-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .info-row-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary-tint);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .info-row-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .info-row-text span, .info-row-text a {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .info-cta-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .btn-contact-call {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.25);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-contact-call:hover {
      background: var(--primary-light);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .btn-contact-zalo {
      background: #0068ff;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 104, 255, 0.25);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-contact-zalo:hover {
      background: #0056d6;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Visual Map Wrapper */
    .map-frame-wrapper {
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 420px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .map-frame-wrapper iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 420px;
      border: 0;
    }

    /* ---- FOOTER ---- */
    .footer {
      background: #111a15;
      color: #d1d5db;
      padding: 48px 0 28px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      height: 52px;
      width: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .footer-links a {
      color: #9ca3af;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .footer-bottom {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .footer-admin-link {
      color: #4ade80;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .footer-admin-link:hover {
      color: #86efac;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* ---- MOBILE FLOATING BOTTOM ACTION DOCK ---- */
    .mobile-dock {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 12px;
      left: 14px;
      right: 14px;
      z-index: 999;
      background: rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-around;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .dock-btn {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2px;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .dock-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.92);
    }
    .dock-btn i {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    .dock-btn.highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a373, #bc6c25);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.4);
      margin-top: -6px;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    /* ---- DISH DETAIL MODAL / BOTTOM SHEET ---- */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .modal-sheet {
      background: #ffffff;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.96);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      max-height: 90vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open .modal-sheet {
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
    .modal-close-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 14px;
      right: 14px;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 10;
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }
    .modal-img-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16/10;
      position: relative;
      background: #eee;
    }
    .modal-img-wrapper img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .modal-body {
      padding: 24px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .modal-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--accent-warm);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .modal-title {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .modal-price {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-warm);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .modal-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .modal-toppings-title {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .modal-toppings-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .modal-topping-tag {
      background: var(--primary-tint);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.15);
    }
    .modal-action-bar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .modal-btn-zalo {
      flex: 1;
      background: #0068ff;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 104, 255, 0.28);
    }
    .modal-btn-call {
      flex: 1;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 67, 50, 0.28);
    }

    /* ---- RESPONSIVE MEDIA QUERIES ---- */
    @media (max-width: 991px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 36px;
      }
      .hero-media-wrapper {
        max-width: 540px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 36px;
      }
      .contact-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .nav-links {
        display: none; /* Mobile header navigation handled cleanly */
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding-bottom: 96px;
      }
      .top-bar {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .top-bar-text-desk {
        display: none;
      }
      .top-bar-text-mobi {
        display: inline;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }
      .header-inner {
        height: 58px;
      }
      .header-logo {
        height: 38px;
        width: 38px;
      }
      .header-brand {
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .header-brand-info h1 {
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .header-brand-info span {
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .call-text-desktop {
        display: none;
      }
      .call-text-mobile {
        display: inline;
      }
      .btn-call-header {
        padding: 7px 12px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        gap: 5px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 18px 0 32px;
      }
      .hero-tag {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 1.85rem;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      .hero-desc {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }
      .hero-actions {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .btn-primary-hero, .btn-secondary-hero {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 11px 8px;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: var(--radius-full);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .hero-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 6px;
        padding-top: 14px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .stat-pill {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .stat-pill i {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      .stat-pill strong {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }
      .stat-pill span {
        font-size: 0.68rem;
      }
      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .value-card-thumb {
        aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      }
      .value-pill-badge {
        font-size: 0.64rem;
        padding: 2px 6px;
        bottom: 6px;
        left: 6px;
      }
      .value-card-body {
        padding: 10px 10px 14px;
        gap: 4px;
      }
      .value-card h3 {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }
      .value-card p {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }
      .products-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .card-content {
        padding: 12px;
      }
      .card-title {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
      .card-price {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
      .card-desc {
        display: none; /* Keep mobile cards super compact & clean */
      }
      .card-toppings-preview {
        display: none;
      }
      .btn-card-order {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }
      .about-image-collage {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .about-img-sub {
        display: none;
      }
      .info-card-box {
        padding: 24px 18px;
      }
      /* Mobile modal as bottom sheet */
      .modal-sheet {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        max-width: 100%;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) 0 0;
        max-height: 85vh;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- TOP LIVE ANNOUNCEMENT BAR -->
  <aside class="top-bar" aria-label="Thông báo cửa hàng">
    <span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="top-bar-text-desk">🌿 <strong>Chè Thong Dong:</strong> Đang mở cửa đón khách • 09:00 - 22:30 mỗi ngày • Hotline: <a href="tel:<%= storeInfo.phone %>" style="color: #fde047; text-decoration: underline;"><%= storeInfo.phoneDisplay %></a></span>
    <span class="top-bar-text-mobi">🌿 <strong>Mở cửa:</strong> 09:00 - 22:30 • Hotline: <a href="tel:<%= storeInfo.phone %>" style="color: #fde047; text-decoration: underline;"><%= storeInfo.phoneDisplay %></a></span>
  </aside>

  <!-- STICKY NAVBAR -->
  <header class="header" id="mainHeader">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="/menu" class="header-brand" aria-label="Trang chủ Chè Thong Dong">
          <img src="/logo_icon.png" alt="Logo Chè Thong Dong" class="header-logo" onerror="this.src='<%= storeInfo.logoPath %>'">
          <div class="header-brand-info">
            <h1><%= storeInfo.brandName %></h1>
            <span><%= storeInfo.subTitle %></span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Desktop Nav -->
        <nav aria-label="Menu chính">
          <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#hero" class="nav-link active">Trang chủ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#menu" class="nav-link">Thực đơn</a></li>
            <li><a href="#toppings" class="nav-link">Topping</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about" class="nav-link">Về quán</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-link">Liên hệ</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-cta-group">
          <a href="tel:<%= storeInfo.phone %>" class="btn-call-header" aria-label="Gọi hotline <%= storeInfo.phoneDisplay %>">
            <i class="bi bi-telephone-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="call-text-desktop"><%= storeInfo.phoneDisplay %></span>
            <span class="call-text-mobile">Gọi ngay</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="hero" id="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-text-content">
          <div class="hero-tag">
            <i class="bi bi-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tươi Mới Mỗi Ngày • 100% Nguyên Liệu Tự Nhiên
          </div>
          <h2 class="hero-title">
            Thanh Mát Từng Muỗng,<br>
            <em>Thong Dong</em> Từng Phút Giây.
          </h2>
          <p class="hero-desc">
            Tiệm chè &amp; đá bào trứ danh tại Thanh Hóa. Vị ngọt thanh thanh từ đường thốt nốt nguyên chất hòa quyện cùng nước cốt dừa tươi sánh béo và thảo mộc tự nhiên tốt cho sức khỏe.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#menu" class="btn-primary-hero">
              <i class="bi bi-cup-hot-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Khám Phá Menu</span>
            </a>
            <a href="<%= storeInfo.googleMapsUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary-hero">
              <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill text-danger" aria-hidden="true"></i>
